# Bytes at the top of RAM reserved for the resident scene core, under the 256 B handoff
# block at 0x801FFF00. The program links for RAM_SIZE_OVERRIDE = 2M - this, so STACK_INIT
# is the window's base and the stack grows down from there. 8192 is psx-scene-abi's
# CORE_WINDOW (SDK branch lane/disc-scenes-1123, provisional until the SDK lane's P1):
# window 0x801FDF00..0x801FFF00, RAM_SIZE_OVERRIDE 0x1FE000. HLPSX_CORE_WINDOW overrides
# it for one build; 0 is the whole 2 MiB.
8192
